-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY DATA
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

The application ingests Consultant-led Referral to Treatment (RTT) Waiting
Times statistics published by NHS England. That data is not covered by this
licence and remains subject to its own terms.

NHS England publishes these statistics under the Open Government Licence v3.0:
https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

Required attribution when reusing the data:

    Source: NHS England, Consultant-led Referral to Treatment Waiting Times.
    Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government
    Licence v3.0.

No NHS England data is redistributed in this repository. Source workbooks are
downloaded at build time from the official publication pages.

This project is an independent portfolio prototype. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or connected to NHS England or any NHS organisation.
